  "content": "# <img src=\"https://cdn-raw.modrinth.com/data/6uJCfiCH/0b4983e0ba8cac6ffe2cc5c2076a8a6b0b28fd1f.png\" alt=\"Spooklementary 標誌\" width=\"60\" height=\"auto\" /> &nbsp; Spooklementary\n\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/5N45SAsC3X\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"靜態徽章\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/discord-white?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=rgb(210%2C%20106%2C%206)&label=加入&labelColor=rgb(4%2C%2011%2C%2020)&color=rgb(210%2C%20106%2C%206)\">\n</a>\n&nbsp;\n<img alt=\"靜態徽章\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/iris%2C%20optifine%2C%20oculus%20%7C%201.7.10%20至%20最新版-white?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&label=支援&labelColor=rgb(4%2C%2011%2C%2020)&color=rgb(210%2C%20106%2C%206)\">\n&nbsp;\n<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/SpacEagle17\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"靜態徽章\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/spaceagle17-white?style=for-the-badge&logo=patreon&logoColor=rgb(210%2C%20106%2C%206)&label=支援&labelColor=rgb(4%2C%20111%2C%2020)&color=rgb(210%2C%201106%2C%206)&link=https%3A%2F%2Fpatreon.com%2Fspaceagle17\">\n</a>\n\n## Spooklementary 是什麼？\n\n* Spooklementary 由 SpacEagle17 製作，是 EminGT 的 [Complementary Shaders]() 修改版。\n* 這是一個恐怖主題的著色器包，能將你的遊戲轉變為陰暗詭異的體驗。\n* 非常適合萬聖節或恐怖地圖！點擊頁面上方的「圖庫」查看螢幕截圖。\n\n**重要提醒：請勿將使用此附加元件時的任何錯誤回報給 Emin，而是透過 [Discord]() 回報給我。**\n\n## 連結\n<center>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/SpacEagle17\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7f94a4d0b4854a694e1b3dbb5aa8e42fc15bce89.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" />\n    <br><br>\n  </a>\n</div>\n</center>\n\n* SpacEagle17 的 **[<ins>Discord</ins>]()** 伺服器，用於討論、問題、建議...\n* 在 **[<ins>Twitter/X</ins>]()** 上追蹤 SpacEagle17，以獲取著色器包的最新消息\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe style=\"width:655px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/CndrX1R5boQ\" width=\"455\" height=\"384\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></div>\n\n## 由 Ember Host 贊助\n正在尋找價格實惠且可靠的 Minecraft 伺服器託管服務？Ember Host 提供超值方案與頂級支援！\n\n點擊橫幅，或在結帳時使用代碼 **[EUPHORIA]()**，即可享有首次購買 **10%** 折扣。此外，你購買金額的 **70%** 將用來支援 Euphoria Patches！\n\n<a href=\"https://www.euphoriapatches.com/ember-referral\"><img src=https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/545bcc6a4800cae3bace3a58a06e0dab9eccf9e4_0.webp></a>",
